   "sourceHash": "247fa2f77b5c9c49fd214973ddaff7f72d679c3dc3f766399f09df27926ae588",
   "text": "一位患者在Kairali Ayurvedic Healing Village绿意环绕的花园拱门下练习瑜伽后弯动作",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
